  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/55427fedbef023bf52d8e045e6d39e616a56caa8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"106\"></p><p>Reflectify RT 旨在通过先进的反射技术和电影级光照提升您的视觉体验。它专注于表面和水体与世界的交互方式，在不增加复杂性的前提下，将您的游戏过程转化为生动而真实的体验。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c3050ac158ae37f3e100a717b4b08ff40cbcf268.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"106\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0f46728b8e38f65f4622bbc51d97f336c04bd322.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eaac91e36be8ee2df4c026f0a47680db94274253.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/be7afea7162e8d87beeb2ececc9323447cbb364e.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/791f6262853215e5e3f9555530ea00b1956839c8.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/24ac310d8e9286d4533bd94dd2210531027c81ce.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/769a4bd0e3ac1d8141e6b4b0a87d0ad95abceebd.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/37c7ebdd84639a737a34d329718963ba8701fba7.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/52a639e06f8b65a1a71e7d05e86e1bc17d49e2db.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e4e67587f8d391062f4540a687cf8ef07d028f0b.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2a3f0b2a39d7f1e48838deb77a5c27f6d313c4d5.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db65dc1f6c164739ddd718be1d1bf5101125a45c.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6a8291b53602fa07f0c7e77f6694b0244cd5e642.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"106\"></p><p>💧&nbsp;<strong>SSR 反射</strong>：冰雪与光滑表面的高质量反射效果。</p><p>🌧️&nbsp;<strong>湿润效果</strong>：降雨时地面出现的逼真反射。</p><p>🌊&nbsp;<strong>水下效果</strong>：清澈见底的水体，呈现自然光线散射与扭曲。</p><p>☀️&nbsp;<strong>上帝光</strong>：柔和温暖的光柱穿透树木与建筑。</p><p>🌿&nbsp;<strong>自然效果</strong>：树叶、草地及植物平滑的摇曳动画。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3f4b99cb12ffebbfba90135d4c0c41d6657ce21e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"106\"></p><p>您可以通过设置轻松开关功能或调整反射强度来自定义体验。此光影包高度优化，即便在 GT 1030 或同等低端硬件上也能流畅运行。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a37b8ef759c70f7ba2f523f879cff996444907a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"106\"></p><p><strong>开发者</strong>：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fin2bubble\" rel=\"nofollow\">in2bubble</a></p><p><strong>许可协议</strong>：保留所有权利</p>",
